        rdfs:label "Huang et al. (2004, 2010) & Pinto & Ermentrout (2001) neocortical spiral wave dynamics & phase singularity topology — Reproducibility package: 60/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Provides `--self-test` and deterministic execution, requiring expansion to an 8-check verification suite covering all 6 regimes, Lean 4 invariants, plaquette winding detection, specimen CV segmentation, and bitwise two-run determinism." ;
